#: secret_santa/specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:4
msgid ""
"Organize a Secret Santa gift exchange (\"Wichteln\") with Nextcloud users "
"and external guests.\n"
"\n"
"- Create lists of participants, both Nextcloud users and guests by name and "
"email\n"
"- Write the email every participant receives\n"
"- Draw the partners and notify every participant by email whom to give a "
"gift\n"
"- Nobody draws the same partner as in the previous draw\n"
"- Exclude partners, e.g. couples, from drawing each other"
msgstr ""

